{"id":"0834bea6989e10f4","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-buchholz-psi.md","title":"df buchholz psi","display":"df buchholz psi","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-buchholz-psi","aliases":["72-df-buchholz-psi"],"display":"df buchholz psi","depends_on":["[[72-df-cantor-normal-form]]","[[72-df-derivative-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Buchholz, A new system of proof-theoretic ordinal functions (1986), §1, print196–197/PDF3–4, https://epub.ub.uni-muenchen.de/3841/1/3841.pdf","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_kind":"supplementary-primary-or-local-derivation","review_2026_10_23":"显式声明Ord为ZFC元理论序数类，辅助定义仍留在Assertion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-buchholz-psi"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-buchholz-psi</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df buchholz psi"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eaeefe0a6812ba97\" href=\"?note=eaeefe0a6812ba97\" title=\"72-df-cantor-normal-form\">72-df-cantor-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e6f1cb167547409f\" href=\"?note=e6f1cb167547409f\" title=\"72-df-derivative-ordinal\">72-df-derivative-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Buchholz, A new system of proof-theoretic ordinal functions (1986), §1, print196–197/PDF3–4, <a href=\"https://epub.ub.uni-muenchen.de/3841/1/3841.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://epub.ub.uni-muenchen.de/3841/1/3841.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"supplementary-primary-or-local-derivation"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23","html":"显式声明Ord为ZFC元理论序数类，辅助定义仍留在Assertion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>元理论ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu,u\\le\\omega\">\\(\\nu,u\\le\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\xi,\\gamma\">\\(\\alpha,\\xi,\\gamma\\)</span> 为实际序数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_\\nu\">\\(\\Omega_\\nu\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sum}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sum}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sum}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sum}\\)</span> 的输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是序数集合。</li>\n<li>空和约定为0。按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 超限递归，同时定义所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\le\\omega\">\\(\\nu\\le\\omega\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_\\nu(\\alpha),\\psi_\\nu(\\alpha)\">\\(C_\\nu(\\alpha),\\psi_\\nu(\\alpha)\\)</span>；右侧仅使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi&lt;\\alpha\">\\(\\xi&lt;\\alpha\\)</span> 的已定义ψ值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_\\eta\">\\(\\varepsilon_\\eta\\)</span> 是正规函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\mapsto\\omega^\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\mapsto\\omega^\\beta\\)</span> 的不动点按序枚举，取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e6f1cb167547409f\" href=\"?note=e6f1cb167547409f\" title=\"72-df-derivative-ordinal\">72-df-derivative-ordinal</a> 的导函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BH}\">\\(\\mathrm{BH}\\)</span> 为本节点定义的特定约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 表示ZFC元理论的序数类；对它的类量化和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span> 的类定义均按可定义公式模式读取，不把真类当作集合参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_0:=1,\\qquad\\Omega_\\nu:=\\aleph_\\nu\\quad(0&lt;\\nu\\le\\omega),\\qquad\n\\mathbb P:=\\{\\omega^\\beta:\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Omega_0:=1,\\qquad\\Omega_\\nu:=\\aleph_\\nu\\quad(0&lt;\\nu\\le\\omega),\\qquad\n\\mathbb P:=\\{\\omega^\\beta:\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sum}(A):=\\{a_0+\\cdots+a_{k-1}:k\\in\\omega\\land(a_i)_{i&lt;k}\\in(A\\cap\\mathbb P)^k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sum}(A):=\\{a_0+\\cdots+a_{k-1}:k\\in\\omega\\land(a_i)_{i&lt;k}\\in(A\\cap\\mathbb P)^k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nC^0_\\nu(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\Omega_\\nu,\\\\\nC^{n+1}_\\nu(\\alpha)&amp;:=C^n_\\nu(\\alpha)\\cup\\operatorname{Sum}(C^n_\\nu(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\psi_u(\\xi):u\\le\\omega\\land\\xi\\in\\alpha\\cap C^n_\\nu(\\alpha)\\land\\xi\\in C_u(\\xi)\\},\\\\\nC_\\nu(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}C^n_\\nu(\\alpha),\\\\\n\\psi_\\nu(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\min\\{\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\gamma\\notin C_\\nu(\\alpha)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BH}&amp;:=\\psi_0(\\varepsilon_{\\Omega_1+1}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nC^0_\\nu(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\Omega_\\nu,\\\\\nC^{n+1}_\\nu(\\alpha)&amp;:=C^n_\\nu(\\alpha)\\cup\\operatorname{Sum}(C^n_\\nu(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\psi_u(\\xi):u\\le\\omega\\land\\xi\\in\\alpha\\cap C^n_\\nu(\\alpha)\\land\\xi\\in C_u(\\xi)\\},\\\\\nC_\\nu(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}C^n_\\nu(\\alpha),\\\\\n\\psi_\\nu(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\min\\{\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\gamma\\notin C_\\nu(\\alpha)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BH}&amp;:=\\psi_0(\\varepsilon_{\\Omega_1+1}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>精确采用Buchholz1986 §1（印刷196–197，PDF3–4），包含常被略去的ξ∈C_u(ξ)条件。其P(γ)⊆C条款等于有限加法主序数求和条款，见该文Proposition1.1。每次C^n是集合，ω并仍是序数集合；必有未在该集合内的序数，故最小值存在。外层超限递归由只调用较小ξ保证良定义。这里给出语义序数函数；尚未把论文§2全部递归OT语法抄成另一个记号系统，二者不能当作同一类型。</p>\n<p>2026-10-23 续审：本次已重新读取 Buchholz 1986 §1 的原始论文印刷196–197/PDF3–4，核对同时超限递归、各闭包阶段及 ξ∈C_u(ξ) 条件。有限加法主序数之和对应源文 P(γ)⊆C 阶段；语义序数函数仍与论文后续递归 OT 语法分开。该来源是原条已列的补充论文，不能归入《Handbook》某个未核实的定义编号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-cantor-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"eaeefe0a6812ba97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-cantor-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-derivative-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"e6f1cb167547409f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-derivative-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-derivative-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"e6f1cb167547409f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varepsilon_\\eta$ 是正规函数 $\\beta\\mapsto\\omega^\\beta$ 的不动点按序枚举，取 [[72-df-derivative-ordinal]] 的导函数；$\\mathrm{BH}$ 为本节点定义的特定约定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\nu,u\\le\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\xi,\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sum}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sum}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\le\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"C_\\nu(\\alpha),\\psi_\\nu(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi<\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\mapsto\\omega^\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_0:=1,\\qquad\\Omega_\\nu:=\\aleph_\\nu\\quad(0<\\nu\\le\\omega),\\qquad\n\\mathbb P:=\\{\\omega^\\beta:\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sum}(A):=\\{a_0+\\cdots+a_{k-1}:k\\in\\omega\\land(a_i)_{i<k}\\in(A\\cap\\mathbb P)^k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nC^0_\\nu(\\alpha)&:=\\Omega_\\nu,\\\\\nC^{n+1}_\\nu(\\alpha)&:=C^n_\\nu(\\alpha)\\cup\\operatorname{Sum}(C^n_\\nu(\\alpha))\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\psi_u(\\xi):u\\le\\omega\\land\\xi\\in\\alpha\\cap C^n_\\nu(\\alpha)\\land\\xi\\in C_u(\\xi)\\},\\\\\nC_\\nu(\\alpha)&:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}C^n_\\nu(\\alpha),\\\\\n\\psi_\\nu(\\alpha)&:=\\min\\{\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\gamma\\notin C_\\nu(\\alpha)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BH}&:=\\psi_0(\\varepsilon_{\\Omega_1+1}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3057,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-321","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-buchholz-psi|df buchholz psi]] · 补充：Buchholz 1986"},{"id":"58974046a284c742","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{ID}_n$ 是 [[72-df-id-theory]] 的全部正算子有限迭代版本，$|T|$ 为 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 的约定。$\\Omega_\\nu,\\varepsilon_\\eta,\\psi_\\nu,\\mathrm{BH}$ 取 [[72-df-buchholz-psi]] 的具体定义；不是任意命名的ψ。"},{"id":"7db447da07adcf15","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{ID}_n$ 是 [[72-df-id-theory]] 的全部正算子有限迭代版本，$|T|$ 为 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 的约定。$\\Omega_\\nu,\\varepsilon_\\eta,\\psi_\\nu,\\mathrm{BH}$ 取 [[72-df-buchholz-psi]] 的具体定义；不是任意命名的ψ。"},{"id":"a370c651bd39d70c","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"各系统取依赖文件给出的公理句集合；$\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR}$ 取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]。对 $T\\in\\{\\mathsf{RCA}_0,\\mathsf{ACA}_0,\\mathsf{ATR}_0,\\Pi^1_1\\operatorname{-CA}_0\\}$，$T^{\\rm PR}$ 在 Assertion 中定义；$\\mathsf{WKL}_0$ 已含 $\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR}$。$|T|$ 取 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]，仅施于符合其PR语言定义域的理论。$\\varepsilon_0,\\Gamma_0$ 分别如同名定义；坍缩函数严格采用 [[72-df-buchholz-psi]]。"}],"outgoing":["eaeefe0a6812ba97","e6f1cb167547409f"]}